Well, that's a relief. It came to what I thought was coming.
But it isn't dreadful. Since I took note of the [mixed signals](2026-10-17-mixed-signals/) something had changed.

I realised that I need to take back action and initiative.
Like I always did - and did best whenever I didn't care.

Let me be clear: I don't care.

Because thanks to a friend I realized what I should do, what I want to do.
Turns out there is an option I didn't see before!

Now I see it. Now the power is back in my court.

Looking back I've been in this tunnel of inertia, of fear and worry.
Pointless.

I am out of that, seeing the light ahead. Seeing the next adventure, ready to take it step by step.
Will it lead me to a new shore? Maybe. Maybe not. It will, however make sure that I'm not floating in the waves, but will sail my own course.

On to new shores or old, into the light. 
